{
  "id": "04-direct-lake-question",
  "title": "The Direct Lake interview question",
  "duration": 41.952,
  "beats": [
    {
      "text": "A Fabric interview question. Your sales data is stored as Delta tables in OneLake.",
      "asset": "directlake",
      "device": "tile",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.3227,
      "voice_end": 5.1627
    },
    {
      "text": "You want import style query performance without copying the entire dataset into the model.",
      "asset": "directlake",
      "device": "focus",
      "start": 5.3227,
      "end": 10.688,
      "voice_end": 10.528
    },
    {
      "text": "Which storage mode fits? Import? Direct Query? Or Direct Lake?",
      "asset": "directlake",
      "device": "quiz",
      "start": 10.688,
      "end": 14.688,
      "voice_end": 14.528
    },
    {
      "text": "Pause here and choose your answer.",
      "asset": "directlake",
      "device": "focus",
      "start": 14.688,
      "end": 16.448,
      "voice_end": 16.288
    },
    {
      "text": "Direct Lake. It loads the columns needed for queries from Delta tables in OneLake.",
      "asset": "directlake",
      "device": "focus",
      "key": "Direct Lake",
      "start": 16.448,
      "end": 21.408,
      "voice_end": 21.248
    },
    {
      "text": "A refresh updates metadata. It does not import the entire dataset again.",
      "asset": "framing",
      "device": "sequence",
      "start": 21.408,
      "end": 26.048,
      "voice_end": 25.888
    },
    {
      "text": "Here is the detail to check. Direct Lake on SQL can fall back to Direct Query.",
      "asset": "directlake",
      "device": "focus",
      "start": 26.048,
      "end": 31.2427,
      "voice_end": 31.0827
    },
    {
      "text": "Direct Lake on OneLake does not use that fallback. Their security behavior differs too.",
      "asset": "framing",
      "device": "sequence",
      "start": 31.2427,
      "end": 36.2027,
      "voice_end": 36.0427
    },
    {
      "text": "Read the comparison before choosing a mode. The correct design depends on the source and permissions.",
      "asset": "directlake",
      "device": "focus",
      "start": 36.2027,
      "end": 41.952,
      "voice_end": 41.792
    }
  ],
